Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.74,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais de 32 banhos públicos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:03.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Numa cidade só.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:05.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Dizem que ninguém tomava banho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Paris, século 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mas em casa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:12.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,encher uma tina custava caro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.23,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Água carregada e aquecida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:15.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,No dia a dia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:16.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,só bacia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:17.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na rua,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.68,Legenda,,0,0,0,,banho era negócio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Com guilda e regras.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vapor: 2 denários.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:22.68,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Banho completo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,4 denários.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até pregoeiros gritavam pelas ruas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,chamando clientes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:29.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Londres tinha 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Viena chegou a 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E Paris...
